// downstep ꜜ), NASALISATION (ã õ ũ), and VOWEL LENGTH (doubling / ː) — none of TONE or LENGTH is in the standard
// orthography (both lexical), so the folds strip them and we compare the SEGMENTAL + NASALISATION backbone.
